// ============================================================================
//  mod_bloodhound.zone  -  THE BLOODHOUND AND THE MEAT WAGON
//
//  User, 2026-09-27: port the Bloodhound revolver (Black Ops III, Shadows of
//  Evil) into the mystery box, and make `.give bloodhound` work.
//
//  SOURCE: Halo / SickoHours' Beta 2 Der Riese port, handed off as
//  bloodhound-b2-fastfiles.zip (mod.ff sha256 dbd36e05...). The zip carried the
//  fastfile only, so every asset below was dumped out of it, renamed off its
//  hashed hbh_* names, and rebuilt raw in zone_assets\:
//    - models, materials and textures: the friend's, unchanged apart from names.
//    - the 27 view anims: the friend's motion, retargeted onto the BO2
//      viewhands' arm lengths. His clips keyed BO3 bone lengths (elbow 10.73,
//      wrist 9.81 against BO2's 12.09 / 11.57), which drew short forearms and
//      fingers on these arms. Shoulder/elbow/wrist were re-solved so each wrist
//      stays on the same spot on the gun (max drift 0.01 units). Receipts:
//      modding-jobs\bloodhound-port-001\retarget.log.
//    - the base gun's 57 recordings: the missing sound bank, carved out of BO3's
//      own zm_common / zm_zod banks by the key the handoff named each file after.
//
//  WHAT IS NOT DECLARED HERE:
//    - the three defs. They ship raw in weapons\zm\ (bloodhound_zm,
//      bloodhound_upgraded_zm, bloodhoundlh_upgraded_zm).
//    - fx, tracer, icons, projectile: every one the defs name is on all six
//      maps and in mod.ff already (the pistol flashes, the M&S PaP flashes,
//      fx_tmp_m203_flash, fx_trail_grenade, projectile_m203grenade,
//      hud_python, hud_icon_colt, reticle_side_small, tracer pistol).
//    - the Meat Wagon's sounds: the stock wpn_1911_*_pap rows on every map's
//      bank, which is what the friend's own build used.
// ============================================================================

// --- view / world models (materials and images come along) ------------------
xmodel,t7_bloodhound_view
xmodel,t7_bloodhound_view_lh
xmodel,t7_bloodhound_world
xmodel,t7_bloodhound_world_lh
//  the Meat Wagon's round: stock's M&S grenade, re-declared (mod_base links it)
xmodel,projectile_m203grenade

