// --- dive-to-prone and crawl: BO3 has none, so these are the stock Python
//     (base) and Mustang & Sally (Meat Wagon) clips with every Bloodhound gun
//     bone keyed as the form's idle keys it. The stock clips never key the
//     tag_*_animate bones, so while prone the speedloader, rounds and spent
//     casings fell back to the rest pose 6-12 units off the gun (user, round 7).
//     Built by modding-jobs\bloodhound-port-001\round8\prone_clips.py. -----
